.TH RNG_RANGE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
rng_range \- A random integer in [lo, hi], both ends inclusive: rng_range(&g\->rng, 1, 6) is a die
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqrng.h\(dq
.BI "int rng_range(uint64_t *s, int lo, int hi);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
A random integer in [lo, hi], both ends inclusive: rng_range(&g\->rng, 1, 6) is a die. hi must be >= lo.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
an integer from lo to hi.
.SH MODULE
math (src/engine/math/rng.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rng_float (3),
.BR rng_between (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
